5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to be cautious with the budget this year. I want to see where the money actually goes before we commit to a destination.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. We should also consider the administrative burden on the organizers. We can't have the planning process overshadowing the training.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I believe the social dynamic is just as important. We need a place that encourages the different year-groups to actually bond.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I am concerned about the quality of rest. If we don't sleep well, the training suffers. I want to know about the actual conditions.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We must ensure the costs are distributed fairly. I want to look into how we handle cancellations and the actual transport expenses.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll start by checking the ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" and ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets.""","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will look into the ""Lottery and application for public group bookings"" and ""Canteen closure and last year's cooking duty.""","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I'll examine ""What the seniors say about year-groups mixing"" and the ""Attendance sheets for the away camps.""","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I'll check the ""Accounts from two clubs that went inland"" and the ""Prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds.""","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I will also look at ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" and ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets"" to verify the financial risks.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
