60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Looking at the options, Option A is risky due to the deposit. Option B is safe financially. Option C is cheap but unpredictable.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option C is out. The municipal lottery is an administrative disaster. Option B is the easiest to organize, though maybe less immersive.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Option B fails the bonding test. If people commute or stay separately, the year-groups won't mix. Option A provides the best environment.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Option C's dorms sound like a nightmare based on the inland reports. Option A offers a whole building, which is much better for sleep.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A's non-refundable deposit is a dealbreaker for me. Option B is the only one that doesn't penalize the group for late cancellations.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, I agree. The financial instability of Option A is too high. Option B is the most responsible choice for the club account.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Minako, we can't prioritize bonding over the sanity of the organizers. Option B removes the cooking and booking stress.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Toshio, but if the camp is a failure socially, the effort of organizing it was wasted. Option A is worth the risk.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, I agree that Option A is superior for rest and bonding, provided we can manage the cost. Option C is definitely out.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, the cost isn't just a number; it's a risk shared by the members. Option B is the only fair way to handle the fee.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I cannot support Option A. The risk of a deficit is too great. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Option B is the only rational choice to prevent organizer burnout. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minako,,I cannot accept a plan that ignores the social decay of the club. I vote for Option A.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I value the quality of the training and sleep. Option A is the best fit. I vote for Option A.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Asuka,,Fairness and financial stability are paramount. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,The majority seems to favor the stability of Option B.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,It is the only sustainable path.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minako,,"It is a disappointing compromise, but I see the concerns.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I hope we can still find a way to rest well.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Asuka,,It is the most logical decision.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
